OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'magpie-like' thief who posed
OL,4,Aas a house sitter
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the outside, Arianna Rose appeared
OL,7,Fto be a woman who lived a lavish
OL,8,Flifestyle, driving expensive cars and
OL,9,Fwearing designer clothes.
OL,11,FBut in reality the 40-year-old was a
OL,12,Fcon artist, posing as a house sitter to
OL,13,Fsteal from unsuspecting homeowners,
OL,14,Ftaking silverware, jewellery and even
OL,15,Fin one case, a Le Creuset Balti pan.
OL,23,APub: 11-JulQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
