OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'magpie-like' thief who posed
OL,4,Aas a house sitter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "magpie-like" thief would not only
OL,7,Fsteal from her victims, targeting those
OL,8,Fwho appeared wealthy with big homes,
OL,9,Fpolice said, but in one case made a
OL,10,Ffamily dinner and cake when they
OL,11,Freturned from holiday, as told on the
OL,12,FBBC's Strange But True Crime podcast.
OL,14,FRose, from London, splashed out on
OL,15,Flobster and champagne at luxury hotel
OL,16,FClaridge's, in Mayfair, while living a
OL,17,Flife beyond her means.
OL,23,APub: 11-JulQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
